  "duration_s": 461.589002,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "一九四六年，英国伦敦，一家皮草店里，一个二十八岁的中国留学生攥着刚领到的薪水，想给国内的妻子买件皮大衣，店员上下扫了他一眼，鼻子里哼出一声，这么贵的东西，你们中国人买得起吗？这句话像一把刀扎进了这个年轻人的心里。他没吵没闹，攥着钱，转身就走。但你记住这个画面，这个被人当面羞辱，买不起的中国人十几年后会亲手在罗布泊升起一朵蘑菇云，让整个西方国家再也不敢小看中国。他叫陈开甲，说出来，你可能不信这位后来的中国和司令，小时候是个实打实的问题少年。一九一八年，程开甲出生在江苏吴江盛泽镇的商人。家庭含着金汤匙长大，祖父给他取名开甲，盼的是开科取士，金榜题名。可天有不测风云，七岁丧父，九岁，母亲被逼迫离家，一个本该无忧无虑的孩子，一夜之间成了没人管的野孩子。他开始叛逆。小学二年级，连续留级三年，同学给他起外号叫年年老板十二岁那年更离谱，偷拿家里的钱，一个人跑到上海流浪花个金光厚露宿街头被家人找回去痛打了一顿。你以为这孩子这辈子就毁了，没有那顿打？加上一九三一年九一八事变国土沦丧的消息，向两记重锤把他砸醒了，他突然明白了自己再怎么胡闹。在一个快要亡国的国家里，什么都不是。从那天起，这个留级三年的学渣像换了一个人。他把所有叛逆和愤怒全拧成了一股劲。读书学科学救中国。他曾为钻研课业三天三夜，不眠不休十九岁考上浙江大学，整个大学是在抗战炮火声中读完的。浙大一路西迁，搬了七个地方。他跟着一路逃亡，一路学那段日子把一句话刻进了。他骨头里落后就要挨打师。九四六年八月，程开甲公费留学英国爱丁堡大学师从物理学。泰斗波恩教授这个岛是什么级别？诺贝尔奖得主城开家也争气。他和导师联手提出超导电双待模型，在国际学术界崭露头角。可学术上的光环，换不来英国人的尊重。走在伦敦街头，他会无缘无故被人翻白眼、去海边游泳。几个英国人一看，中国人下水了，立马上岸，嘴里嘟囔着，有批人把我们的水都弄脏了去商店买东西。店员一看，是中国人，态度立马冷下来，开头那件皮大衣的事儿，只是无数次歧视中的一次，他心里清楚，在英国人眼里，你学问再高，也低人一等。陈开甲忍了，他不是懦弱，他在等一个机会，这个机会。一九四九年来了。一九四九年四月，英国军舰紫石英号无视警告，擅自闯入长江水域，被解放军炮火直接击中，搁浅后升起白旗投降。消息传到英国程开甲，看到报纸的那一刻，这个向来理性克制的物理学家当场哽咽了。他一拳砸在桌子上，眼泪止不住的流。在后来，九十多岁的程老回忆起这一幕，还是激动的拍桌子，说完就忍不住掩面而泣。他为什么哭？因为他等这一天，等了太多年了。从鸦片战争到那时，西方国家欺负了中国一百多年，现在中国人终于敢对着英国军舰开火了，而且打赢了程开甲说了一句话，我就知道我们有这一天的，是时候回去了，他要回去，不是回去当教授，过安稳日子，而是回去给这个一穷二白的国家铸一把。护国的剑临走前，他做了一个让所有人都看不懂的决定，把英国攒的积蓄全拿出来。真皮大衣、收音机这些值钱东西全卖了，换成了国内根本买不到的学术资料和精密仪器。那个曾经穿着西装，走在伦敦街头的洋博士，回国的时候，肩扛手提大包小包，像个逃难。一九五零年八月，程开甲回到祖国，先在浙江大学任教。一九五二年，院系调整，他被调到南京大学学校，把他当归国高级知识分子，要给他定二级教授。他填表师执意不要二级，只肯领三级的工资，说国家正在打仗，我这份薪金够用了。教学之余，他一个人编写了中国第一部固体物理学专著。那时候国内这方面资料几乎空白，他硬是一个字，一个字啃出来。如果日子就这么过下去，陈开甲可能会成为一个受人尊敬的大学教授。但一九六零年一直掉令，彻底改变了他的人生。那一年，程开甲四十二岁，正是科学家出成果的黄金年龄。他接到通知，立刻去北京报道，去干什么，去哪里去多久，不能问，不能说，连家人都不能告诉他。对妻子高耀山只说了一句话，我要出趟远差。从那天起，程开甲这个名字，在学术界彻底消失了，没有人知道他去了哪里，没有人知道他在干什么。他像人间蒸发一样，从所有公开场合所有学术期刊里消失的干干净净。三年后，一九六三年，他第一次踏上了罗布泊的土地。那地方有个外号叫死亡之海，这一消失就是整整四十年。先点个赞，把这条视频收藏起来，再转发给身边的朋友。他在罗布泊到底经历了什么？为什么一个浏阳博士会变成让西方国家闻风丧胆的中国核司令下集？我接着讲。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00001",
      "start_ms": 70,
      "end_ms": 1050,
      "text": "一九四六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00002",
      "start_ms": 1250,
      "end_ms": 2190,
      "text": "英国伦敦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00003",
      "start_ms": 2690,
      "end_ms": 4110,
      "text": "一家皮草店里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00004",
      "start_ms": 4210,
      "end_ms": 8830,
      "text": "一个二十八岁的中国留学生攥着刚领到的薪水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00005",
      "start_ms": 9190,
      "end_ms": 12130,
      "text": "想给国内的妻子买件皮大衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00006",
      "start_ms": 12750,
      "end_ms": 14570,
      "text": "店员上下扫了他一眼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00007",
      "start_ms": 14850,
      "end_ms": 16190,
      "text": "鼻子里哼出一声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00008",
      "start_ms": 16790,
      "end_ms": 17870,
      "text": "这么贵的东西，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00009",
      "start_ms": 18110,
      "end_ms": 20450,
      "text": "你们中国人买得起吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00010",
      "start_ms": 21410,
      "end_ms": 25530,
      "text": "这句话像一把刀扎进了这个年轻人的心里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26070,
      "end_ms": 27210,
      "text": "他没吵没闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00012",
      "start_ms": 27930,
      "end_ms": 28590,
      "text": "攥着钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00013",
      "start_ms": 28710,
      "end_ms": 29815,
      "text": "转身就走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00014",
      "start_ms": 30680,
      "end_ms": 32080,
      "text": "但你记住这个画面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00015",
      "start_ms": 32600,
      "end_ms": 34420,
      "text": "这个被人当面羞辱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00016",
      "start_ms": 34540,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "买不起的中国人十几年后会亲手在罗布泊升起一朵蘑菇云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00017",
      "start_ms": 42080,
      "end_ms": 45500,
      "text": "让整个西方国家再也不敢小看中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00018",
      "start_ms": 46240,
      "end_ms": 47280,
      "text": "他叫陈开甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00019",
      "start_ms": 48320,
      "end_ms": 48840,
      "text": "说出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48840,
      "end_ms": 52140,
      "text": "你可能不信这位后来的中国和司令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00021",
      "start_ms": 52440,
      "end_ms": 54940,
      "text": "小时候是个实打实的问题少年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00022",
      "start_ms": 55480,
      "end_ms": 56500,
      "text": "一九一八年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00023",
      "start_ms": 56940,
      "end_ms": 60650,
      "text": "程开甲出生在江苏吴江盛泽镇的商人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00024",
      "start_ms": 60650,
      "end_ms": 63225,
      "text": "家庭含着金汤匙长大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00025",
      "start_ms": 63830,
      "end_ms": 65905,
      "text": "祖父给他取名开甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00026",
      "start_ms": 66360,
      "end_ms": 68175,
      "text": "盼的是开科取士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69140,
      "end_ms": 70135,
      "text": "金榜题名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00028",
      "start_ms": 70390,
      "end_ms": 71865,
      "text": "可天有不测风云，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00029",
      "start_ms": 72370,
      "end_ms": 73525,
      "text": "七岁丧父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00030",
      "start_ms": 73930,
      "end_ms": 74410,
      "text": "九岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00031",
      "start_ms": 74490,
      "end_ms": 76205,
      "text": "母亲被逼迫离家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00032",
      "start_ms": 76650,
      "end_ms": 78905,
      "text": "一个本该无忧无虑的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00033",
      "start_ms": 79320,
      "end_ms": 82195,
      "text": "一夜之间成了没人管的野孩子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00034",
      "start_ms": 82610,
      "end_ms": 83605,
      "text": "他开始叛逆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00035",
      "start_ms": 84180,
      "end_ms": 85180,
      "text": "小学二年级，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00036",
      "start_ms": 85180,
      "end_ms": 86505,
      "text": "连续留级三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00037",
      "start_ms": 87060,
      "end_ms": 92235,
      "text": "同学给他起外号叫年年老板十二岁那年更离谱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00038",
      "start_ms": 92640,
      "end_ms": 93795,
      "text": "偷拿家里的钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00039",
      "start_ms": 94250,
      "end_ms": 101515,
      "text": "一个人跑到上海流浪花个金光厚露宿街头被家人找回去痛打了一顿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00040",
      "start_ms": 102590,
      "end_ms": 104815,
      "text": "你以为这孩子这辈子就毁了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00041",
      "start_ms": 105110,
      "end_ms": 107975,
      "text": "没有那顿打？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00042",
      "start_ms": 108800,
      "end_ms": 113380,
      "text": "加上一九三一年九一八事变国土沦丧的消息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00043",
      "start_ms": 113760,
      "end_ms": 116975,
      "text": "向两记重锤把他砸醒了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00044",
      "start_ms": 118160,
      "end_ms": 122750,
      "text": "他突然明白了自己再怎么胡闹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00045",
      "start_ms": 123170,
      "end_ms": 125210,
      "text": "在一个快要亡国的国家里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00046",
      "start_ms": 125310,
      "end_ms": 126110,
      "text": "什么都不是。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00047",
      "start_ms": 126970,
      "end_ms": 128030,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00048",
      "start_ms": 128290,
      "end_ms": 131070,
      "text": "这个留级三年的学渣像换了一个人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00049",
      "start_ms": 131610,
      "end_ms": 135790,
      "text": "他把所有叛逆和愤怒全拧成了一股劲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00050",
      "start_ms": 136330,
      "end_ms": 139390,
      "text": "读书学科学救中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00051",
      "start_ms": 140370,
      "end_ms": 143830,
      "text": "他曾为钻研课业三天三夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00052",
      "start_ms": 144090,
      "end_ms": 147710,
      "text": "不眠不休十九岁考上浙江大学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00053",
      "start_ms": 147910,
      "end_ms": 151520,
      "text": "整个大学是在抗战炮火声中读完的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00054",
      "start_ms": 152420,
      "end_ms": 153720,
      "text": "浙大一路西迁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00055",
      "start_ms": 153800,
      "end_ms": 154980,
      "text": "搬了七个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00056",
      "start_ms": 155680,
      "end_ms": 157140,
      "text": "他跟着一路逃亡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00057",
      "start_ms": 157160,
      "end_ms": 160780,
      "text": "一路学那段日子把一句话刻进了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00058",
      "start_ms": 160780,
      "end_ms": 165200,
      "text": "他骨头里落后就要挨打师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00059",
      "start_ms": 165200,
      "end_ms": 166520,
      "text": "九四六年八月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00060",
      "start_ms": 167200,
      "end_ms": 173280,
      "text": "程开甲公费留学英国爱丁堡大学师从物理学。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00061",
      "start_ms": 173480,
      "end_ms": 177625,
      "text": "泰斗波恩教授这个岛是什么级别？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00062",
      "start_ms": 179780,
      "end_ms": 182505,
      "text": "诺贝尔奖得主城开家也争气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00063",
      "start_ms": 183190,
      "end_ms": 187095,
      "text": "他和导师联手提出超导电双待模型，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00064",
      "start_ms": 187460,
      "end_ms": 189885,
      "text": "在国际学术界崭露头角。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00065",
      "start_ms": 190070,
      "end_ms": 191485,
      "text": "可学术上的光环，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00066",
      "start_ms": 191890,
      "end_ms": 193495,
      "text": "换不来英国人的尊重。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00067",
      "start_ms": 194200,
      "end_ms": 195515,
      "text": "走在伦敦街头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00068",
      "start_ms": 195930,
      "end_ms": 199805,
      "text": "他会无缘无故被人翻白眼、去海边游泳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00069",
      "start_ms": 200730,
      "end_ms": 201810,
      "text": "几个英国人一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00070",
      "start_ms": 201810,
      "end_ms": 202965,
      "text": "中国人下水了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00071",
      "start_ms": 203400,
      "end_ms": 204235,
      "text": "立马上岸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00072",
      "start_ms": 204630,
      "end_ms": 205610,
      "text": "嘴里嘟囔着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00073",
      "start_ms": 205610,
      "end_ms": 209245,
      "text": "有批人把我们的水都弄脏了去商店买东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00074",
      "start_ms": 209660,
      "end_ms": 210360,
      "text": "店员一看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00075",
      "start_ms": 210360,
      "end_ms": 211085,
      "text": "是中国人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00076",
      "start_ms": 211330,
      "end_ms": 212545,
      "text": "态度立马冷下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00077",
      "start_ms": 212920,
      "end_ms": 214685,
      "text": "开头那件皮大衣的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00078",
      "start_ms": 215170,
      "end_ms": 217595,
      "text": "只是无数次歧视中的一次，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00079",
      "start_ms": 218450,
      "end_ms": 219505,
      "text": "他心里清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00080",
      "start_ms": 220170,
      "end_ms": 221435,
      "text": "在英国人眼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00081",
      "start_ms": 222080,
      "end_ms": 223315,
      "text": "你学问再高，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00082",
      "start_ms": 223600,
      "end_ms": 224555,
      "text": "也低人一等。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00083",
      "start_ms": 224770,
      "end_ms": 225765,
      "text": "陈开甲忍了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00084",
      "start_ms": 226650,
      "end_ms": 227675,
      "text": "他不是懦弱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00085",
      "start_ms": 228530,
      "end_ms": 229995,
      "text": "他在等一个机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00086",
      "start_ms": 230900,
      "end_ms": 231785,
      "text": "这个机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00087",
      "start_ms": 232910,
      "end_ms": 234475,
      "text": "一九四九年来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00088",
      "start_ms": 235830,
      "end_ms": 237465,
      "text": "一九四九年四月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00089",
      "start_ms": 238990,
      "end_ms": 242075,
      "text": "英国军舰紫石英号无视警告，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00090",
      "start_ms": 242520,
      "end_ms": 244415,
      "text": "擅自闯入长江水域，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00091",
      "start_ms": 244850,
      "end_ms": 247075,
      "text": "被解放军炮火直接击中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00092",
      "start_ms": 247900,
      "end_ms": 250125,
      "text": "搁浅后升起白旗投降。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00093",
      "start_ms": 250990,
      "end_ms": 253330,
      "text": "消息传到英国程开甲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00094",
      "start_ms": 253350,
      "end_ms": 254935,
      "text": "看到报纸的那一刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00095",
      "start_ms": 255340,
      "end_ms": 260225,
      "text": "这个向来理性克制的物理学家当场哽咽了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00096",
      "start_ms": 260590,
      "end_ms": 262330,
      "text": "他一拳砸在桌子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00097",
      "start_ms": 262350,
      "end_ms": 264085,
      "text": "眼泪止不住的流。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00098",
      "start_ms": 264520,
      "end_ms": 265160,
      "text": "在后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00099",
      "start_ms": 265180,
      "end_ms": 267995,
      "text": "九十多岁的程老回忆起这一幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00100",
      "start_ms": 268350,
      "end_ms": 269935,
      "text": "还是激动的拍桌子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00101",
      "start_ms": 270510,
      "end_ms": 273045,
      "text": "说完就忍不住掩面而泣。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00102",
      "start_ms": 273930,
      "end_ms": 274935,
      "text": "他为什么哭？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00103",
      "start_ms": 275440,
      "end_ms": 276640,
      "text": "因为他等这一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00104",
      "start_ms": 276660,
      "end_ms": 277940,
      "text": "等了太多年了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00105",
      "start_ms": 278420,
      "end_ms": 280440,
      "text": "从鸦片战争到那时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00106",
      "start_ms": 280720,
      "end_ms": 283324,
      "text": "西方国家欺负了中国一百多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00107",
      "start_ms": 283860,
      "end_ms": 287940,
      "text": "现在中国人终于敢对着英国军舰开火了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00108",
      "start_ms": 288140,
      "end_ms": 290885,
      "text": "而且打赢了程开甲说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00109",
      "start_ms": 291550,
      "end_ms": 293310,
      "text": "我就知道我们有这一天的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00110",
      "start_ms": 293530,
      "end_ms": 294845,
      "text": "是时候回去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00111",
      "start_ms": 296370,
      "end_ms": 297130,
      "text": "他要回去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00112",
      "start_ms": 297230,
      "end_ms": 298550,
      "text": "不是回去当教授，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00113",
      "start_ms": 298550,
      "end_ms": 299765,
      "text": "过安稳日子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00114",
      "start_ms": 300120,
      "end_ms": 303915,
      "text": "而是回去给这个一穷二白的国家铸一把。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00115",
      "start_ms": 304250,
      "end_ms": 306770,
      "text": "护国的剑临走前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00116",
      "start_ms": 307070,
      "end_ms": 311030,
      "text": "他做了一个让所有人都看不懂的决定，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00117",
      "start_ms": 311590,
      "end_ms": 314130,
      "text": "把英国攒的积蓄全拿出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00118",
      "start_ms": 314410,
      "end_ms": 318150,
      "text": "真皮大衣、收音机这些值钱东西全卖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00119",
      "start_ms": 318410,
      "end_ms": 322690,
      "text": "换成了国内根本买不到的学术资料和精密仪器。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00120",
      "start_ms": 323230,
      "end_ms": 324790,
      "text": "那个曾经穿着西装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00121",
      "start_ms": 324810,
      "end_ms": 326690,
      "text": "走在伦敦街头的洋博士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00122",
      "start_ms": 327230,
      "end_ms": 328250,
      "text": "回国的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00123",
      "start_ms": 328250,
      "end_ms": 331010,
      "text": "肩扛手提大包小包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00124",
      "start_ms": 331570,
      "end_ms": 332510,
      "text": "像个逃难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00125",
      "start_ms": 332710,
      "end_ms": 334035,
      "text": "一九五零年八月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00126",
      "start_ms": 334480,
      "end_ms": 336120,
      "text": "程开甲回到祖国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00127",
      "start_ms": 336700,
      "end_ms": 338460,
      "text": "先在浙江大学任教。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00128",
      "start_ms": 338940,
      "end_ms": 339900,
      "text": "一九五二年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00129",
      "start_ms": 339920,
      "end_ms": 340800,
      "text": "院系调整，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00130",
      "start_ms": 341040,
      "end_ms": 343540,
      "text": "他被调到南京大学学校，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00131",
      "start_ms": 343560,
      "end_ms": 345820,
      "text": "把他当归国高级知识分子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00132",
      "start_ms": 346420,
      "end_ms": 347980,
      "text": "要给他定二级教授。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00133",
      "start_ms": 348920,
      "end_ms": 351020,
      "text": "他填表师执意不要二级，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00134",
      "start_ms": 351320,
      "end_ms": 353060,
      "text": "只肯领三级的工资，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00135",
      "start_ms": 353860,
      "end_ms": 355640,
      "text": "说国家正在打仗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00136",
      "start_ms": 355960,
      "end_ms": 357600,
      "text": "我这份薪金够用了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00137",
      "start_ms": 358420,
      "end_ms": 359340,
      "text": "教学之余，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00138",
      "start_ms": 359640,
      "end_ms": 363955,
      "text": "他一个人编写了中国第一部固体物理学专著。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00139",
      "start_ms": 364580,
      "end_ms": 367540,
      "text": "那时候国内这方面资料几乎空白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00140",
      "start_ms": 367600,
      "end_ms": 368840,
      "text": "他硬是一个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00141",
      "start_ms": 368840,
      "end_ms": 370015,
      "text": "一个字啃出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00142",
      "start_ms": 370940,
      "end_ms": 372835,
      "text": "如果日子就这么过下去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00143",
      "start_ms": 373350,
      "end_ms": 378405,
      "text": "陈开甲可能会成为一个受人尊敬的大学教授。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00144",
      "start_ms": 379370,
      "end_ms": 383505,
      "text": "但一九六零年一直掉令，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00145",
      "start_ms": 383930,
      "end_ms": 385775,
      "text": "彻底改变了他的人生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00146",
      "start_ms": 386610,
      "end_ms": 387210,
      "text": "那一年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00147",
      "start_ms": 387390,
      "end_ms": 388705,
      "text": "程开甲四十二岁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00148",
      "start_ms": 389150,
      "end_ms": 391925,
      "text": "正是科学家出成果的黄金年龄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00149",
      "start_ms": 392340,
      "end_ms": 393400,
      "text": "他接到通知，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00150",
      "start_ms": 393700,
      "end_ms": 395060,
      "text": "立刻去北京报道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00151",
      "start_ms": 395240,
      "end_ms": 396115,
      "text": "去干什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00152",
      "start_ms": 396500,
      "end_ms": 398095,
      "text": "去哪里去多久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00153",
      "start_ms": 399240,
      "end_ms": 399785,
      "text": "不能问，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00154",
      "start_ms": 400740,
      "end_ms": 401535,
      "text": "不能说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00155",
      "start_ms": 402450,
      "end_ms": 405410,
      "text": "连家人都不能告诉他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00156",
      "start_ms": 405410,
      "end_ms": 407530,
      "text": "对妻子高耀山只说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00157",
      "start_ms": 407590,
      "end_ms": 408885,
      "text": "我要出趟远差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00158",
      "start_ms": 409820,
      "end_ms": 410720,
      "text": "从那天起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00159",
      "start_ms": 410740,
      "end_ms": 412205,
      "text": "程开甲这个名字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00160",
      "start_ms": 412470,
      "end_ms": 414715,
      "text": "在学术界彻底消失了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00161",
      "start_ms": 415530,
      "end_ms": 417250,
      "text": "没有人知道他去了哪里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00162",
      "start_ms": 417330,
      "end_ms": 418825,
      "text": "没有人知道他在干什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00163",
      "start_ms": 419160,
      "end_ms": 420815,
      "text": "他像人间蒸发一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00164",
      "start_ms": 421360,
      "end_ms": 427265,
      "text": "从所有公开场合所有学术期刊里消失的干干净净。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00165",
      "start_ms": 428170,
      "end_ms": 428790,
      "text": "三年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00166",
      "start_ms": 428790,
      "end_ms": 429535,
      "text": "一九六三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00167",
      "start_ms": 429790,
      "end_ms": 432365,
      "text": "他第一次踏上了罗布泊的土地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00168",
      "start_ms": 433870,
      "end_ms": 436825,
      "text": "那地方有个外号叫死亡之海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00169",
      "start_ms": 437790,
      "end_ms": 441275,
      "text": "这一消失就是整整四十年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00170",
      "start_ms": 441530,
      "end_ms": 442245,
      "text": "先点个赞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00171",
      "start_ms": 443360,
      "end_ms": 445205,
      "text": "把这条视频收藏起来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00172",
      "start_ms": 446000,
      "end_ms": 447995,
      "text": "再转发给身边的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00173",
      "start_ms": 448960,
      "end_ms": 451495,
      "text": "他在罗布泊到底经历了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_cce780c335dff84c_s00174",
